WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:40.580
Chirico, just tell us the truth!

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:41.920
Where is the Prototype?!

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.540
Stubborn SOB, isn't he?

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:10.540
I give him two, three days more, tops.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.500
Looks like it didn't lock down.

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:15.920
Looks closed to me.

00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:21.830
Funny, I don't see anything...

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.420
There he is!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:12.080
Destiny

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.420
All Melkian military tracking
systems now activated.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:17.460
Beginning Operation Shadow.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.080
Program One, locked on.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:25.790
Program One proceeding
east-northeast at 1200 kph.

00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.750
After escaping from the military

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:36.500
I was ensnared into working
the jijirium mine in the city of Uoodo.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:40.080
I thought I'd escaped hell,

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.630
but this was hell, too.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:51.750
Hey!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.580
Never mind me!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.080
Stop it! This is no place to worry
about anyone but yourself-

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:57.170
You there!

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:02.210
Who said you could rest?!

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.040
Dig!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.920
Quit goofin' off!

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.210
Stop it! They'll kill you!

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:37.630
God dammit! I'm running!

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:40.960
I can't take this anymore!

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.330
They'll just get someone else to replace me.

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:48.040
I may get killed trying it,
but at least that's some chance!

00:04:48.710 --> 00:04:49.960
I'm gonna run!

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:06.960
Damn it all, the cops who are supposed to be
stopping this are all on the take.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.830
Mauler!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:18.920
Yeah, boss.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:58.750
What the?!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:05:59.920
Get some light over here!

00:06:03.080 --> 00:06:04.130
Break out!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.250
After them!

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:14.040
After them!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.670
Come on, don't let 'em escape!

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.500
Son of a...!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.500
Don't let him get away!

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.080
You son of a...!

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:27.630
Program One, crisis situation.

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:30.290
Program One, crisis situation.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.710
Program One, crisis situation.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.080
Danger Index: 75

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:48.880
Danger Index: 75

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.500
Danger Index: 75

00:07:58.880 --> 00:08:00.670
Rescue value C... Hurry!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:46.080
It was in Uoodo that I finally
found him, Major Iskui.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:57.460
He and the others on the decommissioned ship,
Teltain, had thrown my life into chaos.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.540
It's been a long six months.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.330
Yeah? What do you want?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:03.750
Open it.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.170
You...!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.040
Who are you?

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:46.330
You...?!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.580
Now, tell me what that mission was all about!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:54.080
What were you after when you
attacked that planetoid?

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.960
You sent me out on that mission
without telling me anything.

00:10:57.960 --> 00:11:00.710
But the place we attacked was
an allied research base!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:41.250
What exactly was that
weird life form you grabbed?

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:45.130
I'm betting it was one of the
military's biggest secrets.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.330
A lot of people died in that war!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.670
One more death would hardly be worth counting!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:01.830
Besides, you people left me to die in space!

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.500
Wait! I'll take you to where
you'll understand everything!

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:14.040
Where I'll understand everything?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:37.830
Shoot!

00:14:05.880 --> 00:14:07.000
Down there!

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.170
Program One, approaching Prototype.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.460
Program One, approaching Prototype.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:30.210
Program One, approaching Prototype.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:37.380
Program One, approaching Prototype.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:57.670
Program One, in contact with Prototype.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:17.290
I'm sure it's her.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.540
She IS the girl I saw!

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:53.250
Don't you remember me?

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.500
I know we've met...

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:04.580
Wait!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:09.710
Emergency! Emergency!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:13.960
Program One and the Prototype
are engaging in combat.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:19.000
Emergency! Emergency!

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:23.080
Program One and the Prototype
are engaging in combat.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:28.420
Emergency! Emergency!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.460
Program One and the Prototype
are engaging in combat.

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:52.290
Before I knew it, we were in an underground
armory fighting each other in our ATs.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:44.040
The clanging of steel and
smell of the gunpowder

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.880
were strangely both familiar
and disquieting to me.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:40.130
You're deadly...

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.790
You're not an ordinary human.

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:45.040
Your piloting skill, your reaction speed.

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.040
I understood.

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.710
This girl was that strange life form I saw.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:06.670
She was called a "PS,"
and was the military's deepest secret.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.580
When I'd deserted the army,

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:16.420
I'd picked up a bloodhound who was after
the secret society which had stolen the PS.

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.880
Always floating somewhere
in the back of my mind

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:24.080
was the mocking laughter of
Capt. Jean Paul Rochina.

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:22.790
To maintain their secret, they destroyed a city.

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:31.830
But all that death and destruction was merely
a prelude to the destiny I'd been burdened with.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.670
Next Episode

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.080
On they travel, through the darkness of space.

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:02.960
Riding within a huge steel box will they find
their dreams? Or does hell await them?

00:23:03.540 --> 00:23:08.830
Within this box will grow a man's love
and a woman's hopes.

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:13.040
Two people entrusted to an unseen controller.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:17.170
But how long until this brief respite is torn apart?

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.580
Next time, "Two People"

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:24.250
Two People

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:24.250
Next Time

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:22.920
The door to the space odyssey is opened.

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:45.960
Samishii toki mo

00:23:45.960 --> 00:23:49.500
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.500 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.380 --> 00:23:59.920
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.920 --> 00:24:03.330
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:09.580
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.580 --> 00:24:13.080
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:16.500
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.000
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.330
Ano hi no anata ga...
